kickmix-macos
=============

This repository redistributes the `kickmix` package from Google's Qualtran project
(https://github.com/quantumlib/Qualtran, directory `kickmix/`), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. Copyright 2026 Google LLC.

Modifications (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b) notice)
-------------------------------------------------------
The following files were added or changed relative to the vendored upstream commit
recorded in CHANGES.md:

  kickmix/src/kickmix/simd/b128_neon.h      added: 128-bit word type on AArch64 NEON
  kickmix/src/kickmix/simd/b256_neon.h      added: 256-bit word type on two NEON registers
  kickmix/src/kickmix/simd/simd.h           changed: select the NEON types on AArch64
                                            unless KICKMIX_DISABLE_NEON is defined
  kickmix/src/kickmix/simd/simd.test.h      changed: instantiate the word-type tests for NEON
  kickmix/src/kickmix/simd/simd.perf.h      changed: instantiate the word-type benchmarks for NEON
  kickmix/src/kickmix/sim/sim.perf.cc       changed: benchmark goal entries for the NEON types

  kickmix/src/kickmix/util/pop_counter.h    changed (2026-10-27): all-ones fast path in
                                            PopCounter::masked_increments
  kickmix/src/kickmix/sim/sim.h             changed (2026-10-27): Sim::apply consumes runs of consecutive
                                            plain CX ops in one loop and counts the run at once
  kickmix/src/kickmix/circuit/circuit_util.cc  changed (2026-10-27): streaming ReactionDepthTracker
  kickmix/src/kickmix/circuit/circuit_util.h   changed (2026-10-27): compute_reaction_depth(const Circuit &)
  kickmix/src/kickmix/circuit/circuit.cc       changed (2026-10-27): Circuit::reaction_depth() no longer
                                               materialises every operation
  kickmix/src/kickmix/py/interactive_simulator.pybind.cc
                                            changed (2026-10-27): write_across_shots /
                                            read_across_shots on 2-D bool arrays pack and
                                            unpack whole 64-bit words instead of one bit at a
                                            time; sim_read_phase reduces the angle natively
                                            and builds the Fraction without a GCD

The complete change set is also provided as the patches listed in patches/series
(neon-simd, popcounter-fastpath, stream-reaction-depth, bulk-shot-io, read-shot-phase, cx-run),
applied in that order.

Files added by this repository that are not part of upstream kickmix (dated 2026-10-27
unless noted): tests/cpp/pop_counter_fastpath.test.cc, tools/ab_bench.sh, tools/ab_bench.py,
tools/verify_parity.sh, tools/verify_parity.py, tools/verify_parallel.py,
tests/test_verify_parallel.py, tests/fake_verifier/, tests/test_shot_io_2d.py, tests/test_cx_run.py, tools/lib.sh,
the workflows under
.github/workflows/, and changes to tools/build.sh, tools/sync_upstream.sh,
tools/cpp_word_type_tests.sh, bench/sim_bench.py and tests/parity_dump.py. All were written
with the assistance of an AI coding model (Claude) as described below.

